  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is spun with angular acceleration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> is in second and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the ball has angular velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and angular position of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi></math>. The most appropriate expression for the angular position of the ball is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
